		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=18791#p18791"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Dans l&#039;onglet admin de l&#039;interface en ligne, j&#039;ai trouvé cette erreur:</p><p>Autovacuum Activé</p><p>Erreur SQL :</p><p>ERROR:&#160; relation &quot;pg_autovacuum&quot; does not exist<br />LINE 2:&#160; &#160; &#160; FROM pg_autovacuum join pg_class on (oid=vacrelid) join...<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ^<br />Dans l&#039;instruction :</p><p>SELECT vacrelid, nspname, relname, enabled, vac_base_thresh, vac_scale_factor, anl_base_thresh, anl_scale_factor, vac_cost_delay, vac_cost_limit <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; FROM pg_autovacuum join pg_class on (oid=vacrelid) join pg_namespace on (oid=relnamespace) ORDER BY nspname, relname</p>]]></content>
